{#
settings/sharing/_lists.html.twig
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Both kinds of public calendar URL, in one section: shared links, and booking
pages.

Together rather than in two sections because they answer one question — "what
can somebody without an account see of my calendar?" — and the answer has to be
readable in one place. A person auditing that after sending a link to the wrong
address should not have to remember there is a second screen.

**Every row says what it reveals.** That is the only reason the list is worth
rendering: a token cannot be shown again, so the row cannot be "the link", and
what it is instead is the statement of what that link is currently permitted to
say. Busy/free is spelled out rather than left as an empty space, because an
absent list of details reads as "not loaded".

**A minted URL appears once, at the top, and is gone on the next render.** It
is passed in rather than read off a row, because nothing on the row can produce
it — see PublicLinkToken. The box says so, so nobody goes looking for a copy
button that cannot exist.

Variables:
  shareLinks        CalendarShareLink[]
  bookingPages      BookingPage[]
  mintedLinkUrl     string|null  a share link URL, shown once
  mintedBookingUrl  string|null  a booking page URL, shown once
#}
{# Two variables, one box: a create or a regenerate on either half sets exactly
   one of them and the other stays null, so there is nothing to choose between.
   Written as two `default()` sets rather than one `??` chain because `??` runs
   a `defined` test, which Twig refuses on an expression rather than a plain
   variable — `mintedLinkUrl|default(null) ?? …` fails to compile. #}
{% set mintedLinkUrl = mintedLinkUrl|default(null) %}
{% set mintedBookingUrl = mintedBookingUrl|default(null) %}
{% set mintedUrl = mintedLinkUrl is not null ? mintedLinkUrl : mintedBookingUrl %}

{% if mintedUrl is not null %}
    {# `select()` on click, so the whole URL can be copied without a clipboard
       permission and without a Stimulus controller for one field. Read-only
       rather than disabled: a disabled input cannot be selected at all, which
       is the one thing this is for. #}
    <div class="mx-4 mt-4 rounded-lg border border-accent/40 bg-accent/5 px-3.5 py-3">
        <p class="text-xs font-medium text-ink">{{ 'calendar.share.minted.heading'|trans }}</p>

        <input type="text"
               readonly
               value="{{ mintedUrl }}"
               onclick="this.select()"
               aria-label="{{ 'calendar.share.minted.heading'|trans }}"
               class="mt-2 w-full h-9 px-3 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono bg-field border border-field text-ink
                      focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent">

        <p class="mt-2 text-[11px] text-ink-faint leading-snug">
            {{ 'calendar.share.minted.once'|trans }}
        </p>
    </div>
{% endif %}

{# ── Shared links ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}

<div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-3 border-b border-line bg-sunken">
    <p class="text-xs text-ink-faint">{{ 'calendar.share.count'|trans({ '%count%': shareLinks|length }) }}</p>

    <button
        data-controller="ui--modal"
        data-action="click->ui--modal#open"
        data-ui--modal-title-value="{{ 'calendar.share.form.add'|trans }}"
        data-ui--modal-src-value="{{ path('app_settings_sharing_link_new') }}"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 h-8 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium bg-accent hover:bg-accent-strong text-accent-ink transition-colors cursor-pointer"
    >
        <i class="fa-solid fa-plus text-[10px]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        {{ 'calendar.share.form.add'|trans }}
    </button>
</div>

{% if shareLinks is empty %}
    <p class="px-4 py-8 text-center text-sm text-ink-faint italic">{{ 'calendar.share.empty_list'|trans }}</p>
{% else %}
    <ul class="py-2 divide-y divide-line">
        {% for link in shareLinks %}
            <li class="px-4 py-2.5">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                        <p class="truncate text-sm text-ink">
                            {{ link.name }}
                            {% if not link.isLive %}
                                <span class="ml-1.5 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium bg-sunken text-ink-faint">
                                    {{ 'calendar.share.revoked'|trans }}
                                </span>
                            {% endif %}
                        </p>

                        <p class="mt-0.5 truncate text-xs text-ink-faint">
                            {% if link.revealed is empty %}
                                {{ 'calendar.share.reveals_busy_free'|trans }}
                            {% else %}
                                {% set names = [] %}
                                {% for detail in link.revealed %}
                                    {% set names = names|merge([detail.transKey|trans]) %}
                                {% endfor %}
                                {{ 'calendar.share.reveals'|trans({ '%details%': names|join(', ') }) }}
                            {% endif %}
                            ·
                            {{ 'calendar.share.covers'|trans({ '%count%': link.calendars|length }) }}
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1">
                        <button
                            data-controller="ui--modal"
                            data-action="click->ui--modal#open"
                            data-ui--modal-title-value="{{ 'calendar.share.form.edit'|trans }}"
                            data-ui--modal-src-value="{{ path('app_settings_sharing_link_edit', { id: link.id }) }}"
                            aria-label="{{ 'calendar.share.action.edit'|trans({ '%name%': link.name }) }}"
                            class="inline-flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-ink-faint hover:bg-hover hover:text-ink transition-colors cursor-pointer"
                        ><i class="fa-solid fa-pen text-[11px]" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>

                        <form method="post" action="{{ path('app_settings_sharing_link_regenerate', { id: link.id }) }}">
                            <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('calendar-sharing') }}">
                            <button type="submit"
                                    aria-label="{{ 'calendar.share.action.regenerate'|trans({ '%name%': link.name }) }}"
                                    class="inline-flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-ink-faint hover:bg-hover hover:text-ink transition-colors cursor-pointer"
                            ><i class="fa-solid fa-rotate text-[11px]" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
                        </form>

                        {% if link.isLive %}
                            <form method="post" action="{{ path('app_settings_sharing_link_revoke', { id: link.id }) }}">
                                <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('calendar-sharing') }}">
                                <button type="submit"
                                        aria-label="{{ 'calendar.share.action.revoke'|trans({ '%name%': link.name }) }}"
                                        class="inline-flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-ink-faint hover:bg-hover hover:text-danger transition-colors cursor-pointer"
                                ><i class="fa-solid fa-ban text-[11px]" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
                            </form>
                        {% endif %}

                        <form method="post"
                              action="{{ path('app_settings_sharing_link_delete', { id: link.id }) }}"
                              data-turbo-confirm="{{ 'calendar.share.delete_confirm'|trans({ '%name%': link.name }) }}">
                            <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('calendar-sharing') }}">
                            <button type="submit"
                                    aria-label="{{ 'calendar.share.action.delete'|trans({ '%name%': link.name }) }}"
                                    class="inline-flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-ink-faint hover:bg-hover hover:text-danger transition-colors cursor-pointer"
                            ><i class="fa-solid fa-trash text-[11px]" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
                        </form>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ul>
{% endif %}

{# ── Booking pages ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}

<div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-3 border-y border-line bg-sunken">
    <p class="text-xs text-ink-faint">{{ 'calendar.booking.count'|trans({ '%count%': bookingPages|length }) }}</p>

    <button
        data-controller="ui--modal"
        data-action="click->ui--modal#open"
        data-ui--modal-title-value="{{ 'calendar.booking.form.add'|trans }}"
        data-ui--modal-src-value="{{ path('app_settings_sharing_booking_new') }}"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 h-8 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium bg-accent hover:bg-accent-strong text-accent-ink transition-colors cursor-pointer"
    >
        <i class="fa-solid fa-plus text-[10px]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        {{ 'calendar.booking.form.add'|trans }}
    </button>
</div>

{% if bookingPages is empty %}
    <p class="px-4 py-8 text-center text-sm text-ink-faint italic">{{ 'calendar.booking.empty_list'|trans }}</p>
{% else %}
    <ul class="py-2 divide-y divide-line">
        {% for bookingPage in bookingPages %}
            <li class="px-4 py-2.5">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                        <p class="truncate text-sm text-ink">
                            {{ bookingPage.name }}
                            {% if not bookingPage.isEnabled %}
                                <span class="ml-1.5 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium bg-sunken text-ink-faint">
                                    {{ 'calendar.booking.disabled'|trans }}
                                </span>
                            {% endif %}
                        </p>

                        <p class="mt-0.5 truncate text-xs text-ink-faint">
                            {{ 'calendar.booking.duration'|trans({ '%count%': bookingPage.slotMinutes }) }}
                            ·
                            {{ 'calendar.booking.lands_on'|trans({ '%calendar%': bookingPage.calendar.name }) }}
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1">
                        <button
                            data-controller="ui--modal"
                            data-action="click->ui--modal#open"
                            data-ui--modal-title-value="{{ 'calendar.booking.form.edit'|trans }}"
                            data-ui--modal-src-value="{{ path('app_settings_sharing_booking_edit', { id: bookingPage.id }) }}"
                            aria-label="{{ 'calendar.booking.action.edit'|trans({ '%name%': bookingPage.name }) }}"
                            class="inline-flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-ink-faint hover:bg-hover hover:text-ink transition-colors cursor-pointer"
                        ><i class="fa-solid fa-pen text-[11px]" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>

                        <form method="post" action="{{ path('app_settings_sharing_booking_regenerate', { id: bookingPage.id }) }}">
                            <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('calendar-sharing') }}">
                            <button type="submit"
                                    aria-label="{{ 'calendar.booking.action.regenerate'|trans({ '%name%': bookingPage.name }) }}"
                                    class="inline-flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-ink-faint hover:bg-hover hover:text-ink transition-colors cursor-pointer"
                            ><i class="fa-solid fa-rotate text-[11px]" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
                        </form>

                        <form method="post" action="{{ path('app_settings_sharing_booking_toggle', { id: bookingPage.id }) }}">
                            <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('calendar-sharing') }}">
                            <button type="submit"
                                    aria-label="{{ (bookingPage.isEnabled ? 'calendar.booking.action.disable' : 'calendar.booking.action.enable')|trans({ '%name%': bookingPage.name }) }}"
                                    class="inline-flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-ink-faint hover:bg-hover hover:text-ink transition-colors cursor-pointer"
                            ><i class="fa-solid {{ bookingPage.isEnabled ? 'fa-toggle-on' : 'fa-toggle-off' }} text-[11px]" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
                        </form>

                        <form method="post"
                              action="{{ path('app_settings_sharing_booking_delete', { id: bookingPage.id }) }}"
                              data-turbo-confirm="{{ 'calendar.booking.delete_confirm'|trans({ '%name%': bookingPage.name }) }}">
                            <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('calendar-sharing') }}">
                            <button type="submit"
                                    aria-label="{{ 'calendar.booking.action.delete'|trans({ '%name%': bookingPage.name }) }}"
                                    class="inline-flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-ink-faint hover:bg-hover hover:text-danger transition-colors cursor-pointer"
                            ><i class="fa-solid fa-trash text-[11px]" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
                        </form>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ul>
{% endif %}
